---
---

<section class="hero section" id="top">
	<div class="container hero-grid">
		<div>
			<p class="section-label">Product · Shipping · Design</p>
			<h1 class="hero-title">
				你好，我是 <span>吴小为</span><br />
				<span class="hero-en">Wei Wu</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="hero-lead">
				产品人。擅长把模糊需求拆成可落地的路线图，推动设计与工程对齐，把想法变成用户真正会用的产品。
			</p>
			<div class="hero-actions">
				<a class="button" href="#works">查看作品</a>
				<a class="button button-ghost" href="https://github.com/bianwuwei" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
					GitHub
				</a>
			</div>
			<ul class="hero-meta" aria-label="关键词">
				<li>产品设计</li>
				<li>路线规划</li>
				<li>交付落地</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
		<aside class="hero-panel" aria-label="定位卡片">
			<div class="panel-card">
				<p class="panel-kicker">当前关注</p>
				<h2>从洞察到上线</h2>
				<p>
					用清晰的问题定义、优先级与反馈闭环，帮助团队更快验证假设、减少返工，持续把价值交付给用户。
				</p>
				<div class="panel-stats">
					<div>
						<strong>B2B / ToC</strong>
						<span>场景经验</span>
					</div>
					<div>
						<strong>0 → 1</strong>
						<span>从想法到版本</span>
					</div>
					<div>
						<strong>跨职能</strong>
						<span>设计 · 研发 · 运营</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</aside>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.hero {
		padding-top: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 5.5rem);
	}

	.hero-grid {
		display: grid;
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	@media (min-width: 900px) {
		.hero-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 3rem;
		}
	}

	.hero-title {
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 7vw, 4rem);
		line-height: 1.15;
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
	}

	.hero-title span {
		color: var(--accent-strong);
	}

	.hero-en {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-top: 0.35rem;
		font-size: 0.45em;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--text-muted) !important;
	}

	.hero-lead {
		margin: 0 0 1.6rem;
		max-width: 36rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-size: 1.08rem;
	}

	.hero-actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.hero-meta {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.55rem;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
	}

	.hero-meta li {
		padding: 0.35rem 0.7rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
	}

	.panel-card {
		padding: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: calc(var(--radius) + 4px);
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		background:
			linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(245, 165, 36, 0.12), transparent 45%),
			var(--bg-elevated);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow);
	}

	.panel-kicker {
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
		color: var(--accent-strong);
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.06em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.panel-card h2 {
		margin: 0 0 0.7rem;
		font-size: 1.45rem;
	}

	.panel-card > p {
		margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	.panel-stats {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.85rem;
	}

	.panel-stats div {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.15rem;
		padding-top: 0.85rem;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
	}

	.panel-stats strong {
		font-size: 1rem;
	}

	.panel-stats span {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
	}
</style>
